  displayName: Autobuff Pass (3 Days)
  description: 'Adds 3 days of Autobuff: every buff skill you slot in the Autopilot window is cast with one Hotbar key, and Autopilot keeps them up. The days count by the clock, as a Kiosk Permit''s do; another Pass adds to the end. Dropped now and then by Hostiles of level 10 and up, and sold in the Nova Store.'
